    <span class="ey" data-r>Freelance Web Design &amp; Development</span>
    <h1 data-r data-d="1">Your business deserves a website that feels <span class="ac">as serious as you are.</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub" data-r data-d="2">I design and build premium websites, landing pages, and digital experiences that make clients trust you before the first conversation.</p>
    <div class="hero-a" data-r data-d="3">
