    <section class="sec" id="services">
    <div class="ct">
    <div class="sec-h" data-r>
    <span class="ey">Services</span>
    <h2>What I can build for you.</h2>
    <p>From full website systems to focused landing pages, every project is crafted with precision and designed to elevate your brand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sv-grid">
    <div class="sv-card" data-r data-d="1">
    <div class="sv-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"/><path d="M2 12l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0L21 12"/><path d="M2 17l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0L21 17"/></svg></div>
    <h3>Signature Websites</h3>
    <p>Custom marketing websites built to feel sharper, cleaner, and more premium than the competition.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sv-card" data-r data-d="2">
    <div class="sv-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91a2.18 2.18 0 0 0-2.91-.09z"/><path d="M12 15l-3-3a22 22 0 0 1 2-3.95A12.88 12.88 0 0 1 22 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35 0 0 1-4 2z"/><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.16 5 0 5 0"/><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.16-1.62 0-5 0-5"/></svg></div>
    <h3>Landing Pages</h3>
    <p>High-conversion pages for campaigns, offers, and launches where one strong action matters.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sv-card" data-r data-d="3">
    <div class="sv-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"/><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"/></svg></div>
    <h3>E-Commerce</h3>
    <p>Online stores that feel elevated while keeping the path to purchase intuitive and fast.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sv-card" data-r data-d="4">
    <div class="sv-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m18 16 4-4-4-4"/><path d="m6 8-4 4 4 4"/><path d="m14.5 4-5 16"/></svg></div>
    <h3>Custom Web Apps</h3>
    <p>Portals, dashboards, and tailored web interfaces designed with the same premium standard.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sv-card" data-r data-d="5">
    <div class="sv-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .962 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .962L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.962 0z"/><path d="M20 3v4"/><path d="M22 5h-4"/><path d="M4 17v2"/><path d="M5 18H3"/></svg></div>
    <h3>Branding &amp; Graphics</h3>
    <p>Logos, flyers, and digital graphics that match your brand's positioning and feel cohesive.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sv-card" data-r data-d="6">
    <div class="sv-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"/><path d="M21 3v5h-5"/><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"/><path d="M3 21v-5h5"/></svg></div>
    <h3>Website Redesigns</h3>
    <p>Transform an outdated site into something that commands respect and reflects your quality.</p>
    </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    </section>
    
    <section class="sec" id="automation">
    <div class="ct">
    <div class="auto-wrap" data-r>
    <div class="auto-content">
    <span class="ey">Intelligent Automation</span>
    <h2>Custom AI workflows that eliminate repetitive work.</h2>
    <p>I design and build AI-powered automations, intelligent pipelines, and system integrations that reduce administrative toil, accelerate customer inquiries, and let your business operate at maximum velocity.</p>
    <div class="auto-features">
    <div class="auto-feat">
    <div class="auto-feat-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/></svg></div>
    <div>
    <h4>Autonomous AI Agents</h4>
    <p>Domain-trained AI specialists and knowledge engines that handle customer inquiries and lead triage around the clock.</p>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="auto-feat">
    <div class="auto-feat-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg></div>
    <div>
    <h4>Connected System Integrations</h4>
    <p>Direct API synchronization between your website, CRMs, email, payment platforms, and back-office databases.</p>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="auto-feat">
    <div class="auto-feat-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg></div>
    <div>
    <h4>Intelligent Business Scaling</h4>
    <p>Replace hours of manual spreadsheets and repetitive data handling with zero-error, reliable automation pipelines.</p>
    </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="auto-actions">
    <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-p">Automate Your Operations</a>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-s" id="askZadaAutomationBtn">Ask Zada About Automation</button>
    </div>
    </div>
