    <div class="wk-media" data-lightbox="assets/work-professional-services-B68gLSwb.png" data-caption="Professional Services — Authority-driven websites"><img src="assets/work-professional-services-B68gLSwb.png" alt="Professional services website" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div class="wk-zoom-hint"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/><path d="M11 8v6"/><path d="M8 11h6"/></svg>Click to enlarge</div></div>
    <div class="wk-body">
    <span class="wk-label">Professional Services</span>
    <h3>Authority-Driven Websites</h3>
    <p>Structured around credibility, differentiation, and a smoother consultation path for expert-led businesses.</p>
    <div class="wk-tags"><span class="wk-tag">Credibility-first</span><span class="wk-tag">Consultation CTA</span></div>
    </div>
    </div>
