    <div class="wk-media" data-lightbox="assets/work-hospitality-lifestyle-BOhuuqm2.png" data-caption="Hospitality & Lifestyle — Brand-rich experiences"><img src="assets/work-hospitality-lifestyle-BOhuuqm2.png" alt="Hospitality and lifestyle website" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div class="wk-zoom-hint"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/><path d="M11 8v6"/><path d="M8 11h6"/></svg>Click to enlarge</div></div>
    <div class="wk-body">
    <span class="wk-label">Hospitality &amp; Lifestyle</span>
