    <section class="sec" id="process">
    <div class="ct">
    <div class="sec-h" data-r>
    <span class="ey">Process</span>
    <h2>From idea to launch in four steps.</h2>
    <p>A clear, deliberate process that keeps the work focused and the outcome premium.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pr-grid">
    <div class="pr-step" data-r data-d="1">
    <div class="pr-num">01</div>
    <h3>Discovery</h3>
    <p>Clarify your audience, offer, brand tone, and what the site needs to communicate.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pr-step" data-r data-d="2">
    <div class="pr-num">02</div>
    <h3>Strategy</h3>
    <p>Structure the story, page flow, and conversion paths so the site feels sharper and calmer.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pr-step" data-r data-d="3">
    <div class="pr-num">03</div>
    <h3>Design &amp; Build</h3>
    <p>Craft premium layouts, custom interactions, and responsive implementation with precision.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pr-step" data-r data-d="4">
    <div class="pr-num">04</div>
    <h3>Launch</h3>
    <p>Ship a polished site that's ready to convert, then evolve it as the business grows.</p>
    </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    </section>
    
    <section class="sec" id="contact">
    <div class="ct">
    <div class="sec-h" data-r>
    <span class="ey">Contact</span>
    <h2>Let's build something worth trusting.</h2>
    <p>Share your goals and I'll recommend a tailored scope — no rigid packages, no hard sell.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-grid">
    <div class="ct-form-w" data-r data-d="1">
    <form class="ct-form" id="contactForm">
    <div class="fd-grid">
    <label class="fd"><span>Name</span><input type="text" name="name" required autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" /></label>
    <label class="fd"><span>Email</span><input type="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" spellcheck="false" placeholder="you@company.com" /></label>
    </div>
    <div class="fd-grid">
    <label class="fd"><span>Company</span><input type="text" name="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Company or brand" /></label>
    <label class="fd"><span>Service</span><select name="service"><option value="">Select a service</option><option>Signature Website</option><option>AI &amp; Workflow Automation</option><option>Website Redesign</option><option>Landing Page</option><option>E-Commerce</option><option>Custom Web App</option><option>Branding &amp; Graphics</option></select></label>
    </div>
    <label class="fd"><span>Timeline</span><input type="text" name="timeline" placeholder="Example: within 4-6 weeks" /></label>
    <label class="fd"><span>Project Goals</span><textarea name="goals" rows="5" required maxlength="4000" placeholder="Tell me what you need, who the site is for, and what a strong outcome looks like…"></textarea></label>
    <div class="fd-hp" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label></div>
    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-p btn-f" id="submitBtn">Send Project Brief</button>
    <p class="fm-note">Your information is only used to respond to your inquiry.</p>
    </form>
    <div class="fm-ok" id="formSuccess" aria-live="polite">
    <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#00f7ff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
    <h3>Message sent.</h3>
    <p>I'll get back to you within one business day. Check your inbox for a confirmation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fm-err" id="formError" aria-live="polite">Something went wrong. Please try again or email knowledgablellc@gmail.com directly.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-side" data-r data-d="2">
    <div class="ct-panel">
    <h3>What to expect</h3>
    <ul class="ct-list">
    <li>A response within one business day</li>
    <li>A focused conversation about your goals</li>
    <li>A tailored scope — no rigid packages</li>
    <li>Clear pricing based on your needs</li>
    </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-panel">
    <span class="ct-dl">Direct contact</span>
    <a href="mailto:knowledgablellc@gmail.com" class="ct-de">knowledgablellc@gmail.com</a>
    <span class="ct-dloc">Based in NYC — working with clients everywhere</span>
    </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    </section>
    
